{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>61歲的黃大煒（David）移居夏威夷約半年，2位姊姊6月14日透過律師宣布他過世，突如其來的死訊讓人措手不及，女友兼經紀人Vicky更被當成局外人，痛哭說「我都不知道David怎麼走的，我到現在還是沒有感覺到他走了，我不相信他就這樣走了」。</p><p>黃大煒的2位姊姊Consulina Wong、Joann Wong，今委託陳鎮宏律師發表聲明，表示黃大煒於美國檀香山時間6月2日（香港時間6月2日）在姊姊的住處驟然離世，聲明更強調2位姊姊是黃大煒的全體繼承人，且除了她們之外，沒有任何人有權利代表黃大煒。</p><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142845333844267008685701.jpeg/1DIVtcEu-69JTzqn4sxOnuteUPFeJEfCJKT-iySk_os\"/><figcaption>黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）</figcaption></figure><p>更多黃大煒女友Vicky的相片：</p><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒與Vicky（Facebook@Vicky MeiMei Chao）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260615/1143137048392110080842176.jpeg/tSDNkF000ONHzKsMUgXTVotSlmPjycLuMswVyDLMFcg\"/><figcaption>黃大煒與Vicky（Facebook@Vicky MeiMei Chao）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒與女友Vicky（Facebook@Vicky MeiMei Chao）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260615/1143138411058827264489615.jpeg/wgXx_L58tuTCDNlhtidbgQIMLa69GpkeZn8OXmZ_Dl4\"/><figcaption>黃大煒與女友Vicky（Facebook@Vicky MeiMei Chao）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒女友Vicky（Facebook@Vicky MeiMei Chao）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260615/1143138408844103680031296.jpeg/b9goubCDV6leN4pAZG7EsrobaguEeP_FAYMlogGDJaI\"/><figcaption>黃大煒女友Vicky（Facebook@Vicky MeiMei Chao）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒女友Vicky（Facebook@Vicky MeiMei Chao）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260615/1143138413223219200025196.jpeg/EoSrquKe9UPIwOBWWu6rokbGIC7yWgHEjEkXl4xJF5c\"/><figcaption>黃大煒女友Vicky（Facebook@Vicky MeiMei Chao）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒女友Vicky（Facebook@Vicky MeiMei Chao）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260615/1143138415454720000632084.jpeg/4aI173DdufF_0fTkD8JzR8gWdWHHsr3P5XnFmOV5xZg\"/><figcaption>黃大煒女友Vicky（Facebook@Vicky MeiMei Chao）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒女友Vicky與鄧紫棋（Facebook@Vicky MeiMei Chao）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260615/1143138405182345216736029.jpeg/g0NS6x3eh7q_ToYMJt7mQnmFz4w7a0L5_cMJLf3DCS0\"/><figcaption>黃大煒女友Vicky與鄧紫棋（Facebook@Vicky MeiMei Chao）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒女友Vicky（Facebook@Vicky MeiMei Chao）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260615/1143138407569035264186590.jpeg/xdlLk-p1uxFYTmFWzNJ6ThPBkPPjY65JmDmLe5g5i3s\"/><figcaption>黃大煒女友Vicky（Facebook@Vicky MeiMei Chao）</figcaption></figure><p>對於黃大煒姊姊發表的聲明，Vicky相當痛心，直指並不合法：</p><p>Vicky痛哭說黃大煒過世了10天之後，她和黃大煒媽媽跟弟弟才收到通知，不只死因成謎，且始終沒有看到死亡證明書，她質疑說「他的繼承人不可能只有2個姊姊，還有媽媽跟2個弟弟，他2個姊姊絕對不可能自己單方面繼承」。而她跟黃大煒情牽近30年，她表示：</p><p>她也強調絕對不可能跟黃大煒分手，表示黃大煒此生從來沒有簽過任何經紀約，「除了2023年簽約杰威爾，那時我也在，解約也是我出來解決」，表明從來不圖什麼，只是欣賞黃大煒的才華，聲淚俱下直呼「David不可能對付我的，不可能的」，令人哀痛。</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀：61歲資深音樂人黃大煒猝逝　家屬證噩耗　曾花逾億台幣救患癌女友】知名男歌手黃大煒今年1月悄悄離開夏威夷，6月14日竟傳出猝逝噩耗，家屬透過律師函證實，黃大煒於檀香山時間2026年6月2日早晨，於姊姊家中驟然離世，享壽61歲（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142845332149768192253719.jpeg/U0gwk3aE7Wa5zbus52KC30F6Pv2OmtZmqZA05KmQNOQ\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：61歲資深音樂人黃大煒猝逝　家屬證噩耗　曾花逾億台幣救患癌女友】知名男歌手黃大煒今年1月悄悄離開夏威夷，6月14日竟傳出猝逝噩耗，家屬透過律師函證實，黃大煒於檀香山時間2026年6月2日早晨，於姊姊家中驟然離世，享壽61歲（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142845333546471424240591.jpeg/o7G1ELv_2yte2AU2IzGXdImX5HeKh2i0-VbuPPlW7jw\"/><figcaption>黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142849454051692544760258.jpeg/7Ti8oi8ePFAXlBoOGDJCdCGFN9ay1FQIcjh1kHI4dZA\"/><figcaption>黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142845336029630464013287.jpeg/L_cR-vx2hIfwTWvLfNOY8Qur0jIl_WQDKr84Yyq_OGM\"/><figcaption>黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142845338537955328320561.jpeg/my07dCNbQ_iaBmD3M6ZrqasmPrfclpTUkNtWF5DbVhc\"/><figcaption>黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142845341159526400095463.jpeg/mOorlPMSqNbt4ny1IzyRFWZ313rRE673IEku0CBJLtA\"/><figcaption>黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142845343567187968764831.jpeg/MPF8EbetLLMD-K-KNYDihMLlzmXgJKFA_kAbBP5AGwQ\"/><figcaption>黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142845336113516544825091.jpeg/gWMkFzkWAHbINv4tycQcoiZyIvDT3kN9v5rKzr-ays4\"/><figcaption>黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142845338340823040386751.jpeg/eBV-OZS61osHFGIJliOPl83-Oj6TXzQEE8lJ2xPJSds\"/><figcaption>黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142845340685570048465273.jpeg/GIQxI6lBE-Mg5Gub2AYoU4pcN2PcyQr6Pv9gmD7_YJg\"/><figcaption>黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260614/1142845343059677184786531.jpeg/xL2OlpXzirwFuFXNLT4q2u_sPppqKnxXzNCh4MzQoeA\"/><figcaption>黃大煒（Facebook@黃大煒 (Huang Dawei)）</figcaption></figure><p>慟別黃大煒！黃珊珊哭整天反擊黃姊 「我才是委任律師」：死因離奇</p><p>專訪／郭鑫霸氣發言有加分！追求時間不夠長 徐至琦還要再觀察</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-15T04:38:23.359793+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1393,"images":19,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}